{"record":"parent_entry","position":{"parent_record":"response:00000000000000000018:0000:0000","subposition":null},"original_role":"assistant","source":"tool_call","trust":"untrusted","provenance":null,"content":"{\"kind\":\"tool_call\",\"id\":\"fc_01a16557f15a72e78dfc0985da8565ee\",\"call_id\":\"call_01a16557f15a72e78dfc0985da8565ee\",\"name\":\"write_file\",\"arguments\":\"{\\\"content\\\":\\\"# v2 decisions (locked)\\\\n\\\\n1. Platform: self-hosted Supabase (Auth + Postgres). Game writes via server\\\\n   service-role key only; RLS deny-all; clients never write game tables.\\\\n2. Efficiency: `max(30, 100 - distance * 0.005)`; faction link +10, in-game\\\\n   booster +10; hard cap 100. Pinned values: 0->100, 2k->90, 6k->70, 10k->50, 14k->30 floor.\\\\n3. World: 20000x20000 units, 100x100 chunks of 200x200, 20x20 build grid per chunk.\\\\n4. Scatter: jittered random chunk + anchor, min distance 150u (25 tries) then 75u, 50 tries total.\\\\n   Assigned chunks never reused; deleted accounts anonymise to ruins.\\\\n5. Economy: see shared/economy.js (server-authoritative 2s tick, idempotent per shard+tick).\\\\n6. Booster: in-game currency only (500 credits, +10% / 7 days, 1 active, 7-day cooldown, cap 100).\\\\n   No real money anywhere (GPL hobby project).\\\\n7. Deploy: Vercel hosts static frontend now (`game-v2.html`, `admin/`); game server runs\\\\n   as `server/` (Vercel function shim in `api/socket.js`, or `npm start` on a VPS later).\\\\n8. Assets/maps: owner-created only; provenance recorded in ASSETS_LICENSES.md / IMPORTS_LICENSES.md.\\\\n9. Redis/MariaDB-style internals never public: Postgres + Redis on private network, only NGINX 443 exposed.\\\\n\\\",\\\"path\\\":\\\"docs/v2/DECISIONS.md\\\"}\"}","truncated":false}
{"record":"parent_entry","position":{"parent_record":"request:00000000000000000096:0000","subposition":null},"original_role":"tool","source":"tool_result","trust":"untrusted","provenance":null,"content":"{\"kind\":\"tool_result\",\"call_id\":\"call_01a16557f15a72e78dfc0985da8565ee\",\"output\":\"wrote 1223 bytes to \\\\\\\\?\\\\C:\\\\Users\\\\danie\\\\OneDrive\\\\github-repos\\\\stranded-horizons\\\\docs\\\\v2\\\\DECISIONS.md\"}","truncated":false}
{"record":"parent_entry","position":{"parent_record":"response:00000000000000000019:0000:0000","subposition":null},"original_role":"assistant","source":"tool_call","trust":"untrusted","provenance":null,"content":"{\"kind\":\"tool_call\",\"id\":\"fc_01a165580c737630b8eb55a69451a7c6\",\"call_id\":\"call_01a165580c737630b8eb55a69451a7c6\",\"name\":\"write_file\",\"arguments\":\"{\\\"content\\\":\\\"# v2 socket protocol (v1)\\\\n\\\\nAuth: Supabase JWT in handshake `auth.token`. Server rejects unauthenticated sockets.\\\\nClient -> server intents only; server never trusts client-computed resources/positions.\\\\n\\\\n- `chunk:get` -> `{ ok, base } | { ok:false, error }`\\\\n- `place { grid_x 0-19, grid_y 0-19, type }` -> `{ ok } | insufficient_resources | occupied | out_of_bounds | unknown_building`\\\\n- `booster:activate` -> `{ ok, expires_at } | insufficient_credits | already_active | on_cooldown`\\\\n- `link:request { targetBaseId }` -> `{ ok } | self_link | unknown_base`\\\\n- `link:confirm { otherBaseId, accept }` -> `{ ok } | no_pending_link`\\\\n- `admin:cmd { line }` (admin allowlist only) -> `{ ok, ran, args } | forbidden`\\\\n  - `:tp x y`, `:give <resource> <amount>`, `:place <type>`; every call -> admin_audit.\\\\n- Server fan-out: Redis `chunk:update` (reload hint; MariaDB is the truth).\\\\n\\\\nVersions: every message carries protocol v1; unknown versions are rejected.\\\\n\\\",\\\"path\\\":\\\"docs/v2/PROTOCOL.md\\\"}\"}","truncated":false}
{"record":"parent_entry","position":{"parent_record":"request:00000000000000000098:0000","subposition":null},"original_role":"tool","source":"tool_result","trust":"untrusted","provenance":null,"content":"{\"kind\":\"tool_result\",\"call_id\":\"call_01a165580c737630b8eb55a69451a7c6\",\"output\":\"wrote 949 bytes to \\\\\\\\?\\\\C:\\\\Users\\\\danie\\\\OneDrive\\\\github-repos\\\\stranded-horizons\\\\docs\\\\v2\\\\PROTOCOL.md\"}","truncated":false}
{"record":"parent_entry","position":{"parent_record":"response:00000000000000000020:0000:0000","subposition":null},"original_role":"assistant","source":"tool_call","trust":"untrusted","provenance":null,"content":"{\"kind\":\"tool_call\",\"id\":\"fc_01a165581e6f73068f0c7d201e8ab41e\",\"call_id\":\"call_01a165581e6f73068f0c7d201e8ab41e\",\"name\":\"write_file\",\"arguments\":\"{\\\"content\\\":\\\"# v2 self-hosting\\\\n\\\\n## Vercel (now)\\\\n- Static frontend deploys as-is: `index.html`, `game.html` (v1), `game-v2.html`, `admin/`.\\\\n- `api/socket.js` is the optional serverless socket shim; set in Vercel env:\\\\n  `SUPABASE_JWT_SECRET`, `CORS_ORIGINS` (your Vercel domain), `DATABASE_URL`,\\\\n  `REDIS_URL` (omit Redis for single-instance mode), `DEV_UNAUTHENTICATED=1` only for CI smoke.\\\\n- Set `window.SH_SOCKET_URL` before loading `game-v2.html` if the socket host differs.\\\\n\\\\n## VPS (later)\\\\n1. `cp .env.example .env` and fill `POSTGRES_PASSWORD`, `SUPABASE_JWT_SECRET`, `CORS_ORIGINS`.\\\\n2. `docker compose up -d --build`\\\\n3. Apply SQL: `psql $DATABASE_URL -f db/schema.sql`\\\\n4. Point DNS to the VPS, provision TLS (certbot), keep ports closed except 443.\\\\n5. Nightly `pg_dump`; test restores. Postgres + Redis are on the private\\\\n   `internal` network and are never published — only NGINX 443 is public.\\\\n\\\\n## Notes\\\\n- Supabase CLI local stack is dev-only; never expose it. Production uses the compose stack.\\\\n- No managed backups when self-hosting: the operator owns backups, updates, monitoring.\\\\n\\\",\\\"path\\\":\\\"docs/v2/SELFHOST.md\\\"}\"}","truncated":false}
